{"source":{"data":"@data\nFeature: Encrypted IBR messages (EncryptedMessage)\n\nWhen header.is_msg_encrypted is true the message is not an IBR payload but an\nEncryptedMessage (JWE-like: header, ciphertext, encrypted_key, tag, iv). The suite\nchecks that every part of it is present. Runs offline.\n\n  Scenario Outline: An encrypted \"<action>\" message must be a complete EncryptedMessage\n    Given an encrypted \"<action>\" message\n    Then the encrypted message should be valid\n\n    Examples:\n      | action             |\n      | on-search          |\n      | notify             |\n      | txn-on-status      |\n      | enrollment-updates |\n\n  Scenario Outline: An encrypted message missing \"<field>\" is rejected\n    Given an encrypted \"<action>\" message\n    When its encrypted field \"<field>\" is removed\n    Then the encrypted message should be rejected because of \"<error>\"\n\n    Examples:\n      | action             | field         | error                                             |\n      | on-search          | ciphertext    | must have required property 'ciphertext'          |\n      | on-search          | encrypted_key | must have required property 'encrypted_key'       |\n      | on-search          | tag           | must have required property 'tag'                 |\n      | on-search          | iv            | must have required property 'iv'                  |\n      | on-search          | header        | /message must have required property 'header'     |\n      | on-search          | header.kid    | /message/header must have required property 'kid' |\n      | enrollment-updates | ciphertext    | must have required property 'ciphertext'          |\n      | enrollment-updates | header.alg    | /message/header must have required property 'alg' |\n","uri":"features/ibr_encrypted_messages.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
{"gherkinDocument":{"feature":{"tags":[{"location":{"line":1,"column":1},"name":"@data","id":"25fa0a3b-b66b-4309-a30e-8f95de0dee85"}],"location":{"line":2,"column":1},"language":"en","keyword":"Feature","name":"Encrypted IBR messages (EncryptedMessage)","description":"When header.is_msg_encrypted is true the message is not an IBR payload but an\nEncryptedMessage (JWE-like: header, ciphertext, encrypted_key, tag, iv). The suite\nchecks that every part of it is present. Runs offline.","children":[{"scenario":{"id":"75ad14e7-80c8-4b20-a1e1-8e477deeba24","tags":[],"location":{"line":8,"column":3},"keyword":"Scenario Outline","name":"An encrypted \"<action>\" message must be a complete EncryptedMessage","description":"","steps":[{"id":"6cf87799-4326-47ad-b513-d44d5e25cddf","location":{"line":9,"column":5},"keyword":"Given ","keywordType":"Context","text":"an encrypted \"<action>\" message"},{"id":"a071aa6f-bc11-46b5-9279-dbf786adc047","location":{"line":10,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the encrypted message should be valid"}],"examples":[{"id":"61eb5bdf-9b4a-4c60-b889-0d21185f81ca","tags":[],"location":{"line":12,"column":5},"keyword":"Examples","name":"","description":"","tableHeader":{"id":"3458c23c-4181-4272-b72d-0b2812ed62a0","location":{"line":13,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":13,"column":9},"value":"action"}]},"tableBody":[{"id":"88e8ab9e-d0d2-4f69-9fbd-d67983ddf6e0","location":{"line":14,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":14,"column":9},"value":"on-search"}]},{"id":"58c52339-d429-4204-9024-9200a142aa53","location":{"line":15,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":15,"column":9},"value":"notify"}]},{"id":"cc05fae5-be0f-49c7-b902-b7d8ca6fd62d","location":{"line":16,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":16,"column":9},"value":"txn-on-status"}]},{"id":"91f656f7-c1c7-4eae-a977-6182448ca8ed","location":{"line":17,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":17,"column":9},"value":"enrollment-updates"}]}]}]}},{"scenario":{