{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=ibr/on-unsubscribe\nFeature: Receive the unsubscribe result from the IBR (POST /registry/on-unsubscribe)\n\nThis API is exposed by the subscriber to receive the result of an unsubscribe request.\n\n  Background:\n    Given the \"on-unsubscribe\" endpoint\n\n  @smoke\n  Scenario: Successfully receive a confirmed unsubscription\n    Given an on-unsubscribe callback confirming the unsubscription\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-unsubscribe\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the HTTP status should be 200\n    And the response should have a JSON content type\n    And the response should be received within 15000 ms\n    And the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario Outline: A refused unsubscription with reason code <code> is acknowledged\n    Given an on-unsubscribe callback rejected with reason code \"<code>\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-unsubscribe\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n    Examples: UnSubscribeStatusReasonCode\n      | code                            |\n      | rjct.reference_id.invalid       |\n      | rjct.reference_id.duplicate     |\n      | rjct.timestamp.invalid          |\n      | rjct.subscription_code.invalid  |\n      | rjct.requester.invalid          |\n      | rjct.event.already_unsubscribed |\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario Outline: An invalid on-unsubscribe callback is rejected: <case>\n    Given a valid request\n    And the request field \"<field>\" becomes '<value>'\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model\n\n    Examples:\n      | case                        | field                                | value                 |\n      | missing header              | header                               | <removed>             |\n      | wrong action                | header.action                        | \"unsubscribe\"         |\n      | missing message             | message                              | <removed>             |\n      | missing timestamp           | message.timestamp                    | <removed>             |\n      | missing status              | message.status                       | <removed>             |\n      | unknown status              | message.status                       | \"done\"                |\n      | unknown reason code         | message.status_reason_code           | \"rjct.filter.invalid\" |\n      | subscription status unknown | message.subscription_status.0.status | \"cancelled\"           |\n      | subscription status no code | message.subscription_status.0.code   | <removed>             |\n","uri":"features/ibr_on-unsubscribe.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
{"gherkinDocument":{"feature":{"tags":[{"location":{"line":1,"column":1},"name":"@method=POST","id":"91b855db-09a5-4acb-be2a-cc687a1ab68c"},{"location":{"line":1,"column":14},"name":"@endpoint=ibr/on-unsubscribe","id":"8bd2cdad-434d-42d9-a039-7e5a85f70a47"}],"location":{"line":2,"column":1},"language":"en","keyword":"Feature","name":"Receive the unsubscribe result from the IBR (POST /registry/on-unsubscribe)","description":"This API is exposed by the subscriber to receive the result of an unsubscribe request.","children":[{"background":{"id":"b8878d1e-2738-4891-9d04-cc15ec485d10","location":{"line":6,"column":3},"keyword":"Background","name":"","description":"","steps":[{"id":"311664fd-4511-433d-b643-bb45da9eb39a","location":{"line":7,"column":5},"keyword":"Given ","keywordType":"Context","text":"the \"on-unsubscribe\" endpoint"}]}},{"scenario":{"id":"2aa85fb8-1618-4ec1-a46c-865f7fc9177b","tags":[{"location":{"line":9,"column":3},"name":"@smoke","id":"ed3404bd-ff11-4b95-b1dc-81b3fbbe54d1"}],"location":{"line":10,"column":3},"keyword":"Scenario","name":"Successfully receive a confirmed unsubscription","description":"","steps":[{"id":"765bcb28-b928-4ca4-ab99-4a38adcdec97","location":{"line":11,"column":5},"keyword":"Given ","keywordType":"Context","text":"an on-unsubscribe callback confirming the unsubscription"},{"id":"9165830e-efc6-44a7-9812-02e491e11d29","location":{"line":12,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the request should be a valid \"on-unsubscribe\" message"},{"id":"f74f20f7-45c3-4ea6-aa6a-8ef12db9072d","location":{"line":13,"column":5},"keyword":"When ","keywordType":"Action","text":"the request is sent"},{"id":"b859301d-db7a-4fa4-9f68-d5530a79c8a7","location":{"line":14,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the HTTP status should be 200"},{"id":"2299f4e5-3694-40d8-a4d8-25d4170695db","location":{"line":15,"column":5},"keyword":"And ","keywordType":"Conjunction","text":"the response should have a JSON content type"},{"id":"63b39440-c516-42ce-b7f7-9e2ff249581d","location":{"line":16,"column":5},"keyword":"And ","keywordType":"Conjunction","text":"the response should be received within 15000 ms"},{"id":"ffc5d597-5e04-4f0e-b551-cb9a01eff959","location":{"line":17,"column":5},"keyword":"And ","keywordType":"Conjunction","text":"the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\""}],"examples":[]}},{"scenario":{"id":"3a037c1b-22b5-43ae-9e59-f84cd009aa1e","tags":[{"location":{"line":19,"column":3},"name":"@functional","id":"7a32de24-eeda-4640-96b7-70b57fd3db36"}],"location":{"line":20,"column":3},"keyword":"Scenario Outline","name":"A refused unsubscription with reason code <code> is acknowledged","description":"","steps":[{"id":"974f0777-f968-43ee-a27f-b8639d2e8948","location":{"line":21,"column":5},"keyword":"Given ","keywordType":"Context","text":"an on-unsubscribe callback rejected with reason code \"<code>\""},{"id":"af0e2490-d078-4f12-b2f4-86b158cf5644","location":{"line":22,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the request should be a valid \"on-unsubscribe\" message"},{"id":"d16044c8-8a1e-4c58-beff-02e5182086eb","location":{"line":23,"column":5},"keyword":"When ","keywordType":"Action","text":"the request is sent"},{"id":"e1a8068d-fd8c-4824-92a8-0e801769c62c","location":{"line":24,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\""}],"examples":[{"id":"a6ae1d42-f2f1-4d00-9e30-fe5c58138e5d","tags":[],"location":{"line":26,"column":5},"keyword":"Examples","name":"UnSubscribeStatusReasonCode","description":"","tableHeader":{"id":"8ef41532-a55c-4eab-b063-5d1f8067cd2d","location":{"line":27,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":27,"column":9},"value":"code"}]},"tableBody":[{"id":"4748ed48-46b9-48bc-93c1-530d0ddc07ff","location":{"line":28,"column":7},"cells":[{"location":{"line":28,"column":9},"value":"rjct.reference_id.invalid"}]},{"id":"72812